      "updated": 1792334200271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> This is a good example of how data connections can be used to :\n        ° Save files, \n        ° Upload\n     and \n        ° Download\n\n--> This can be used for a variety of purposes like :\n        ° data being pulled in for model, \n    or \n        ° it could be used as a way to save artifacts \n    or \n        ° to save the models that you've created \n         and make those available for hosting within OpenShift AI",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> This is a good example of how data connections can be used to :\n        ° Save files, \n        ° Upload\n     and \n        ° Download\n\n--> This can be used for a variety of purposes like :\n        ° data being pulled in for model, \n    or \n        ° it could be used as a way to save artifacts \n    or \n        ° to save the models that you've created \n         and make those available for hosting within OpenShift AI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1792334179410,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
